  "description": "Embark on new adventures with the Quest 1 eBike, designed for versatile performance whether you're commuting, cruising, or exploring light trails. Its 6061 alloy frame features internal cable routing and an integrated 48V 14ah 672Wh battery, offering a sleek look and balanced weight distribution for a comfortable ride. The 80mm suspension fork smooths out bumps, enhancing comfort on varied surfaces.\nExperience smooth electric assistance from the 500W rear hub motor, providing a steady boost to your pedaling. Your ride metrics are clearly visible on the LCD handlebar-mounted display. Gear changes are managed with an easy to use L-TWOO 7-speed trigger shifter paired with a Shimano rear derailleur and 14-28T freewheel, offering straightforward shifting that is ready for a wide variety of terrain.\nStopping is simple and controlled thanks to Tektro hydraulic disc brakes offering powerful braking in all conditions. Rolling on quality Kenda 27.5x2.35\" tyres, the Quest 1 provides excellent stability, traction, and comfort wherever your riding takes you. The alloy riser bars (700mm) and an adjustable A-head 80mm stem allow for a customisable and comfortable riding posture. A plush comfort plus saddle and ergo rubber grips complete the package, ensuring every journey is a pleasant one.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
